      "value": "We've ordered maximum containment measures for J-11. There will be no repeat of what happened at Zeta Cygnus II. Enough time and money have already been wasted on setbacks and unfortunate incidents; senior management wants results, and soon. These results are already in sight, but we need to be careful."
